cff-version: 1.2.0
title: AI Hardware Manufacturing Toolkit
message: >-
  If you cite this toolkit, please use the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jett
    family-names: Fu
    affiliation: Breeze
    website: "https://breezehw.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jianjettfu-oss/ai-hardware-toolkit"
url: "https://breezehw.com"
abstract: >-
  Open-source data, checklists, and frameworks for AI hardware
  manufacturing — 1K-volume BOM pricing for ESP32, Rockchip, and
  MediaTek Genio designs; design-for-manufacturing checklists; NRE
  cost budgeting; certification navigation (FCC, CE, UKCA, RCM,
  CCC); EVT/DVT/PVT validation gates; and supplier qualification
  rubrics — based on actual Shenzhen production experience.
keywords:
  - AI hardware
  - hardware manufacturing
  - Shenzhen supply chain
  - BOM cost
  - DFM
  - NRE
  - FCC certification
  - CE certification
  - ESP32
  - Rockchip
  - MediaTek Genio
  - contract manufacturing
license: MIT
